// FlowGraphConnectorType
Define OLEFlowGraphConnectorType for Integer
    Define OLExtpFlowGraphConnectorStraight for 0
    Define OLExtpFlowGraphConnectorStraightArrow for 1
    Define OLExtpFlowGraphConnectorStraightDoubleArrow for 3
    Define OLExtpFlowGraphConnectorCurved for 4
    Define OLExtpFlowGraphConnectorCurvedArrow for 5
    Define OLExtpFlowGraphConnectorCurvedDoubleArrow for 7
    Define OLExtpFlowGraphConnectorElbow for 8
    Define OLExtpFlowGraphConnectorElbowArrow for 9
    Define OLExtpFlowGraphConnectorElbowDoubleArrow for 11

// FlowGraphResize
Define OLEFlowGraphResize for Integer
    Define OLExtpFlowGraphResizeHorizontal for 1
    Define OLExtpFlowGraphResizeVertical for 2
    Define OLExtpFlowGraphResizeBoth for 3

// FlowGraphSmoothingMode
Define OLEFlowGraphSmoothingMode for Integer
    Define OLExtpFlowGraphSmoothingModeHighQuality for 0
    Define OLExtpFlowGraphSmoothingModeHighSpeed for 1
    Define OLExtpFlowGraphSmoothingModeGDI for 2
    Define OLExtpFlowGraphSmoothingModeAuto for 3

// FlowGraphConnectionPointType
Define OLEFlowGraphConnectionPointType for Integer
    Define OLExtpFlowGraphPointNone for 0
    Define OLExtpFlowGraphPointInput for 1
    Define OLExtpFlowGraphPointOutput for 2
    Define OLExtpFlowGraphPointInputAndOutput for 3
    Define OLExtpFlowGraphPointBoth for 4

// FlowGraphShapes
